```bash
sudo apt-get update
sudo apt-get install -y python3 python3-venv python3-pip
python3 -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
```

# Exercise 1: NumPy array properties and slicing

## ex1.A.code — Array properties

```python
import numpy as np

array = np.array([[1, 2, 3], [4, 2, 5]])
print("Array:\n", array)
print("Type:", type(array))
print("Dimensions:", array.ndim)
print("Size:", array.size)
print("Element type:", array.dtype)
```

## ex1.B.code — Row slicing

```python
